2148	// Run ONE global dW work item `gt` (if it belongs to this CTA): decode (weight,
2149	// M-atom GROUP, N-tile), then contract K via the dW GEMM into grad[grad_off]. The
2150	// group is up to kDecDwIL stacked m64 atoms → the engine interleaves them (kIL=
2151	// kDecDwIL): kDecDwIL wgmmas/k-step into independent fragments sharing ONE staged
2152	// X B-tile (H1's win, now on the dW K=T contraction).
2153	template <int N>
2154	__device__ __forceinline__ void dectc_dw_run_tile(
